  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Personally, I find the new desktop HUD visually unappealing, and I would like to see the previous HUD return. In my opinion, the old design looked better and, above all, made notifications much easier to notice. With the current HUD, notifications are displayed in a way that makes them easy to miss. I also feel that the new HUD clutters the desktop view somewhat.\n\nAs a suggestion, it would be great to have an option in the settings that allows users to switch between the new HUD and the previous one.",
